OL,3,GNEWSAPower cuts blamed on birds flying
OL,4,Ainto lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of power cuts on the Isle of
OL,7,FSheppey, which businesses say is making
OL,8,Fthings "difficult", is being blamed on
OL,9,Fbirds flying into overhead power
OL,10,Fcables.
OL,12,FThe power cuts have been happening for
OL,13,Fmore than a month according to
OL,14,Fresidents, causing equipment and
OL,15,Fcomputers to switch off while being
OL,16,Fused by businesses and those working
OL,17,Ffrom home, as well as activating
OL,18,Fburglar alarms.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
