OL,3,GNEWSAPower cuts blamed on birds flying
OL,4,Ainto lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK Power Networks spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"We apologise to customers for
OL,8,Fdisruption caused by recent brief power
OL,9,Finterruptions on the Isle of Sheppey."
OL,11,FThey said devices had been installed on
OL,12,Fthe cables to make them more visible to
OL,13,Flarger birds and help them avoid the
OL,14,Flines.
